  "description": {
   "en": "“You're bound to fall in love when a gal is kind to you!”\n\nDespite dressing flamboyantly with a smidgin of lewdness sprinkle in, these gals occasionally show a pure side that will leave you mesmerized and…?\n\n**Cover:** Kazawa Youhei\n**Contents:**\n1. Kazawa Youhei - Don't Tempt Me, Sakihara-san! / Don't Seduce Me, Sakihara-san!\n2. saku - Kiyokawa-san Is A Gal No Matter How You Look At It! / Kiyokawa-san Is Definitely a Gyaru!\n3. Urano Ritsu - The Childhood Friend Gal Wants To Give A Warm Welcome!\n4. Hidari Ude - The Gal Likes Ramen!\n5. Noki Kuzuri - Munching ♡ Kanna-chan ~A Recipe For Making A Gal Fall In Love With You~\n6. Kamon Shoumi - The Inexperienced Gal Asks Her Teacher For Instruction / The Inexperienced Gyaru Asks for Her Teacher's Lessons",
   "ja": "「ギャルに優しくされたら、恋に落ちるに決まってる！」\n\n派手に着飾ってちょっぴりエッチなギャルたち。だけど時折見せるピュアな表情に見惚れてしまって――？"
  },
